 "validity": "<b>Validity of Quotation:</b> This quotation is valid for 24 hours from the date of issue and is subject to hotel and room availability as no space has been secured. A deposit of RM 250 per person is required upon confirmation, with full payment due 45 days prior to arrival. A late booking surcharge of RM 50 per booking applies to bookings made less than 45 days before departure. Private transportation and driver are based on a 12 hours basis per day; additional hours are charged at 500 THB per hour, payable in cash to the driver. Prices are quoted for 2 to 3 persons per room; a triple room with 3 single beds is subject to availability and an extra bed will be added if no triple bed is available. Peak season surcharge applies as stated and is not included in the base price. Itinerary, price and flight schedule are subject to change. Final itinerary and hotel arrangements will be confirmed at least 15 days before the trip. This package is valid for travel until 31 March 2027. Ground arrangement and tipping only - flight tickets are not included.",
